<title>HONG KONG: Allied Industries names new chairman.</title>
<headline>Allied Industries names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Industries International Ltd said on Wednesday it has appointed Augustine Chow as chairman and chief executive of the company with effect from October 1, replacing Chung Tze Hien who resigned the chairmanship with effect from the same date.</p>
<p>Allied Industries, a subsidiary of Allied Group Ltd, is a property, building materials and manufacturing company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
